  ("Spread voices across stereo (width 60-100%) but keep one centre voice or a mono sub layer below ~150 Hz.","Wide pad, solid centre"),
  ("Filter: 12/24 dB low-pass, cutoff ~1.5-4 kHz, key-tracking ~50%, light resonance; optional slow LFO (0.05-0.3 Hz) on cutoff for drift.","Smooth top, movement over bars"),
  ("Amp envelope: attack 0.3-1.5 s, sustain high, release 1-3 s; optional filter-envelope swell (or a fifth-up layer) to bloom into each chord.","Pad breathes in and out"),
