  ("Filter envelope: fast attack, decay 100-400 ms, sustain low for plucks; scale amount by velocity for dynamics.","Expressive plucks"),
  ("Movement: LFO or stepped (S&H) modulation on cutoff, or morph LP->BP->HP->notch with an LFO.","Animated tone"),
